  "子着色器 → Hidden/lilToonOutline（Opaque + 描边）　·　分类 → 自动（按材质名猜）": "Sub-shader → Hidden/lilToonOutline (Opaque + outline)  ·  Category → Auto (guess from material name)",
  "「参与光照比例」= 1 时这一层会被明暗分档影响（像皮肤的一部分。），= 0 时保持原色（像贴纸/自发光。），中间值按比例混合。\n「剔除」0=两面、1=只背面、2=只正面。只背面需要双面渲染、开了剔除会自动把材质设为双面（关掉时还原。）": "\"Light participation\" = 1 ⇒ this layer is affected by the light banding (like part of the skin); = 0 ⇒ keeps its own colour (like a sticker / emission); intermediate values blend by ratio.\n\"Cull\" 0 = both sides, 1 = back faces only, 2 = front faces only. Back faces only needs double-sided rendering; enabling cull switches the material to double-sided automatically (restored when turned off).",
  "选择要调整的目标：\n  「全部（默认）」= 改全局默认值\n  某个材质 = 只覆盖这个材质（合并显示）": "Choose the target to adjust:\n  \"All (default)\" = edit the global defaults\n  A material = override only that material (merged view)",
  "预设分类（Unity 预设面板里的七项）\n自动 = 按材质名猜：hair⇒头发 · skin⇒皮肤 · cloth⇒布料 · 其它⇒其他": "Preset category (the seven entries in Unity's preset panel)\nAuto = guess from the material name: hair⇒Hair · skin⇒Skin · cloth⇒Cloth · others⇒Other",
  "目标子着色器（Unity 里材质用的变体）\n自动 = 按参数推导：描边 ⇒ *Outline · 裁剪/透明 ⇒ 对应变体\n⚠️ 主着色器没有描边 pass · 玻璃/毛发等变体材质面板也选不到 ⇒ 只能靠这里指定": "Target sub-shader (the variant the material uses inside Unity)\nAuto = derive from parameters: outline ⇒ *Outline · cutout/transparent ⇒ matching variant\n⚠️ The main shader has no outline pass, and glass/fur variants can't be picked in the material panel ⇒ specify it only here",
  "每个材质各导一个 .asset（批量）\n分类按材质名自动猜（可先用左边的下拉强制指定）": "Export one .asset per material (batch)\nThe category is guessed from the material name (force it with the dropdown on the left if needed)",
